Changelog
=========

2.0.0 - 2026-2-9
-----------------

### BREAKING CHANGES

- **Dropped 'legacy' encoding.** Supported encodings are now 'hex' (default),
  'base64', and 'buffer'. If you were using the default encoding in v1.x,
  switch to 'hex' (now the default) or 'buffer'.
- **Minimum Android SDK raised to 24** (was 16).
- **Minimum iOS version raised to 13**.
- **Requires React Native 0.76+** (New Architecture / TurboModule support).

### Other changes

- Complete rewrite using modern React Native architecture (Turbo Modules).
  Supports both Old and New Architecture.
- Migrated Android build from ndk-build to CMake with 16K page size support.
- Migrated to Kotlin (Android) and Objective-C++ (iOS) with TurboModule specs.
- TypeScript rewrite with proper type definitions.
- Example app now uses Expo.

